<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Eleos Stars | Jessica Kender</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --gold: #FFC14C;
            --indigo: #294355;
            --light-blue: #D7EDFC;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --serif: "Georgia", "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
            --sans: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #F4F7F9;
            color: var(--indigo);
            font-family: var(--sans);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .nav {
            padding: 30px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .back-link {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--indigo);
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .nav-logo { height: 30px; }

        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 40px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .badge {
            background: #E0F2FE;
            color: var(--indigo);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .name-title h1 {
            font-family: var(--serif);
            font-size: 4.5rem;
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .name-title h2 {
            font-family: var(--serif);
            font-style: italic;
            font-weight: 400;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            opacity: 0.7;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .profile-frame {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 450px;
            aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
        }

        .profile-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #eee;
            box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(41, 67, 85, 0.1);
            border: 12px solid white;
        }

        .message-box {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
            background: var(--light-blue);
            padding: 80px 100px;
            border-radius: 60px;
            margin-top: 80px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .quote-text {
            font-family: var(--serif);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .attribution {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            opacity: 0.5;
        }

        .moments-section {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
            padding: 100px 0;
        }

        .moments-title {
            font-family: var(--serif);
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .moments-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .moment-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
            border-top: 4px solid var(--gold);
        }

        .moment-card strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: var(--indigo);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; }
            .name-title h1 { font-size: 3rem; }
            .message-box { padding: 40px 20px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="nav">
        <a href="index.html" class="back-link">← Back to Class</a>
        <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Eleos Logo" class="nav-logo">
    </nav>

    <main class="container">
        <div class="name-title">
            <span class="badge">CS Excellence Star</span>
            <h1>Jessica Kender</h1>
            <h2>Implementation Manager</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="profile-frame">
            <img src="/images/jessica.png" alt="Jessica Kender" class="profile-img">
        </div>

        <section class="message-box">
            <div class="quote-text">
                "Jessica has demonstrated exceptional dedication and impact, successfully launching our very first CalMHSA contracted customer while building the scalable processes needed to expand this entire book of business. Over her two years at Eleos, she has consistently proven to be a trusted partner to both customers and colleagues alike. Her ability to navigate high ambiguity with composure and take on complex challenges in stride sets a gold standard for implementation excellence."
            </div>
            <div class="attribution">— Customer Success Leadership</div>
        </section>

        <section class="moments-section">
            <h3 class="moments-title">Star Moments</h3>
            <div class="moments-grid">
                <div class="moment-card">
                    <strong>CalMHSA Landmark Launch</strong>
                    Spearheaded and successfully executed the launch of Eleos's very first CalMHSA contracted customer, marking a pivotal milestone for the organization.
                </div>
                <div class="moment-card">
                    <strong>Scalable Process Architecture</strong>
                    Designed and established robust implementation processes to effectively onboard and manage the CalMHSA book of business at scale.
                </div>
                <div class="moment-card">
                    <strong>Team Onboarding & Mentorship</strong>
                    Expanded team capability by seamlessly onboarding and training team members across CalMHSA accounts to drive collective success.
                </div>
                <div class="moment-card">
                    <strong>Trusted Partner & Ambiguity Master</strong>
                    Leveraged two years of expertise at Eleos to build deep trust across teams and customers, expertly navigating high-ambiguity environments with ease.
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

</body>
</html>
